      "title": "Nvidia opens investigation after report CEO Jensen Huang was target of foreign intelligence",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/08/nvidia-jensen-huang-investigation",
      "description": "<p>CEO reportedly ‌had close relationship ‌with a Chinese businesswoman who passed information to ‌Beijing</p><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/technology/nvidia\">Nvidia</a> said ⁠on Sunday it “is initiating an independent investigation in light of recent reporting that founder and CEO Jensen Huang has been the <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/oct/29/nvidia-ceo-targeted-chinese-spy\">target</a> of a foreign intelligence effort”.</p><p>The <a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/29/us/politics/nvidia-china-jensen-huang-trump.html\">New York Times reported</a> in ​October that <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump\">Donald Trump</a> had been briefed last year on intelligence that Huang ‌had a close relationship ‌with a <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/china\">Chinese</a> businesswoman who passed information to ‌Beijing.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/08/nvidia-jensen-huang-investigation\">Continue reading...</a>",
